email.task:
You are an IT support technician. Ben, a sales manager, reported that his laptop has been very slow this week, and you have started to investigate. Write an email to Ben using the notes below. In your email you must use:
- the present perfect with already and with yet (I have already…, I haven't… yet);
- may, might or could to talk about a possible cause;
- should or try + -ing to suggest a solution.
Write 80–100 words.
